{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b59b6503-731a-8db8-919d-43f9901a80b0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T14:01:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport, Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I direct your call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Janet! Great, a real person! I was on hold for a good while before this, and I swear I'm always on hold exactly when it matters. Anyway, I'm calling about property tax. Is there a senior or veteran exemption, and how would I go about applying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city does offer exemptions for qualifying seniors and for veterans. Eligibility depends on the category, and an application has to be filed with the Tax Assessor's office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! And is there a form for that? Do you have a form number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. [pause] The exemption applications are listed on the assessor's page under forms. I don't see a single number that covers both categories. Which exemption are you asking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. I'm in my fifties, so probably the veteran one. I'd have to check my discharge papers, but I'm asking for that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a veteran exemption, you would need to submit the veteran exemption application along with a copy of your discharge documentation. I can have the assessor's office send the form to you, or you can pick one up at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great! Could you have them email it? Or is mailing better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note either. Mail would need a mailing address. Email would need an address as well, which I'd read back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is perfect. Do you need the address now? I'm calling on my cell, so it's easy to give you the callback number too, it's 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have 401-555-0192. The assessor's office will return your call to confirm the form and the mailing address. There may also be a filing deadline, so please ask them about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, I will! That's so helpful, Janet. Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too! Bye now!"
    }
  ],
